{"title":"2008 UNCO Math Contest II Problems/Problem 5","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_UNCO_Math_Contest_II_Problems/Problem_5&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>5. The sum of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/9/8/298c33bcb65bfefbf9151bb5812af5a7b706426c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$400, 3, 500, 800$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"114\" height=\"16\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/1/0/710d09135a91c1c5d11fa4b952d2a3b2fd4d5069.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$305$\" width=\"26\" height=\"12\" /> is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/b/c/abc1744a459ad135efd3fd45fca7285cae133717.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2008$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"38\" height=\"14\" /> and the product of these five numbers is\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/8/a/d8a53841adb4445c3c554ccfde99e7fd01dd2fb2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$146400000000 = 1464 \\times 10^8.$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"221\" height=\"15\" />\n</p><p>(a) Determine the largest number which is the product of positive integers whose sum is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/b/c/abc1744a459ad135efd3fd45fca7285cae133717.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2008$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"38\" height=\"14\" />.\n</p><p>(b) Determine the largest number which is the product of positive integers whose sum is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/4/174fadd07fd54c9afe288e96558c92e0c1da733a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"13\" height=\"10\" />.\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_UNCO_Math_Contest_II_Problems/Problem_5&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>(a) <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/9/f/c9f869f4a8e8ddef2bb077c35ef8eab7f6680d92.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3^{668}\\cdot 2^2$\" width=\"58\" height=\"15\" /> (b) <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/a/0/1a079a133157529921cf12457ade1197c9494bbe.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3^k$\" width=\"16\" height=\"15\" /> if <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/d/f/adfc09b87da0ee2cb3950ecd2ed61b430fc3bc70.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n=3k$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"56\" height=\"14\" />;  <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/9/3/f93e711bd03c79a1e52886cc1bf98f95564acd23.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2^2\\cdot 3^{k-1}$\" width=\"62\" height=\"15\" /> if <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/3/c/53c656616a839be403fc3a343073475b9dbd4f98.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n=3k+1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"84\" height=\"14\" />;  <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/9/a/79a78e27e2ce3bbce79e8aaf7e5cdd87a0eb2cfb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2\\cdot 3^{k}$\" width=\"38\" height=\"15\" /> if <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/b/f/7bfe3b3000df5941b33ecbe64b96765cfbdf5b2c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n=3k+2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"85\" height=\"14\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_UNCO_Math_Contest_II_Problems/Problem_5&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"b